; Stanza 2 (5.2.0+ox switch). M11 (OxCaml) mode syntax compiles only
; on the ox switch, so this stanza is gated to it. No libraries or
; preludes: the cells lean on the bare ox stdlib (the mode keywords,
; Modes, the stdlib Atomic, Domain.Safe). Cells that would need a
; library not installed on the ox switch (Portable.Atomic, float#,
; Iarray) stay `ocaml skip` and are validated in the browser instead.
; Run with: opam exec --switch nptel-ox -- dune build @lectures/runtest
(mdx
 (enabled_if
  (= %{ocaml_version} 5.2.0+ox))
 (files
  M11-L01-locality.md
  M11-L02-uniqueness.md
  M11-L03-linearity.md
  M11-L04-contention.md
  M11-L05-portability.md
  M11-L06-tutorial.md
  M11-L07-practice.md))
